	JMP INC 		/SYM IS EQUAL TO LOW
	JMP INC 		/SYM IS LESS THAN LOW
	TAD HIPNT 	/SYM IS GREATER THAN LOW
	DCA SORT2 	/NOW SET UP POINTERS FOR CHECK3 ROUTINE
	TAD PNT1 		/TO SEE IF SYM IS LESS THAN HIGH
	DCA SORT1
